{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick Eight</strong> is a narrative-driven mystery and deduction game blending <i>New Chinese Style</i> with <i>Neo-orthodox</i> storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as two intertwined roles, investigating a series of serial murders on an isolated village, gradually uncovering the chilling truth hidden behind the faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/811c812ebb3c78a9e6c245ee660ae41d.avif?t=1759423612\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Eight is division. All things named by the eight stem from separation.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heaven and Earth are governed by the Eight Trigrams, yet mankind dares to divine fate through the number.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/cde3811222253acded156aaa4bdd1fb8.poster.avif?t=1759423612\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/cde3811222253acded156aaa4bdd1fb8.webm?t=1759423612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/cde3811222253acded156aaa4bdd1fb8.mp4?t=1759423612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a remote, isolated village, a century-old blood ritual continues without end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generations of zealous followers uphold a legacy steeped in sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As outsiders begin to vanish mysteriously, fate draws two girls together:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gambler detective, and a lone survivor who once escaped a sacrificial fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they must uncover the truth hidden beneath the veil of tradition and folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who seeks to play god?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who dares to defy the boundaries of science?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when the so-called <i>truth</i> rises to the surface...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you still have the courage to reveal it to the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/67b0b7b5724921cd77c33be3b1c66784.avif?t=1759423612\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve intriguing puzzles through a series of dynamic comic-style scenes, each frame uniquely styled and brimming with creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/8dc751eead92ee44807b189742763672.poster.avif?t=1759423612\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/8dc751eead92ee44807b189742763672.webm?t=1759423612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/8dc751eead92ee44807b189742763672.mp4?t=1759423612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/a96504c873945c7a545a050b4258e232.avif?t=1759423612\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a realistic deduction system inspired by classical logic - use intuition and reasoning to unravel cases that once seemed airtight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/bd0a18467776fbaaad6c3f6fbc6139da.poster.avif?t=1759423612\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/bd0a18467776fbaaad6c3f6fbc6139da.webm?t=1759423612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/bd0a18467776fbaaad6c3f6fbc6139da.mp4?t=1759423612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/ca0ce7b98206bd1b789bf3c2d332670c.avif?t=1759423612\" data-has-big width=800 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic comic-style expressions come vividly to life - immerse yourself in a deeply engaging visual novel experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/40633fa0c618f84b7425e86ce62aa006.poster.avif?t=1759423612\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/40633fa0c618f84b7425e86ce62aa006.webm?t=1759423612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/40633fa0c618f84b7425e86ce62aa006.mp4?t=1759423612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/e46a7f340f0f679e25dbf8803fcbe31c.avif?t=1759423612\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge bonds, break illusions, and navigate a cast of characters whose desires collide unpredictably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the hidden truths behind every mask and motive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/extras/74af5ad5f8043c6f465691de92a77c09.avif?t=1759423612\" data-has-big width=800 height=500 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622370?t=1759423612","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/adaac078742d198da7f4c5cfc008f0b54e3ddab4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759423612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/320293b2fede84b74e013c859b213858ede8eaf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759423612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622370/320293b2fede84b74e013c859b213858ede8eaf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759423612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick Eight</strong> is a narrative-driven mystery and deduction game blending <i>New Chinese Style</i> with <i>Neo-orthodox</i> storytelling.</p><p class=\"